  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nPR #11762 refactored steps around setting the API method trackers, and thereby removed the step where the ongoing API method tracker is set. However, there are still usages of it. \nAs per discussion with @noamr, plans are to remove it altogether.\n\nEither the ongoing API method tracker should be removed (if possible), or it should be set again after [this step](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#inner-navigate-event-firing-algorithm:~:text=If%20apiMethodTracker%20is%20not%20null%2C%20then%20set%20apiMethodTracker%27s%20pending%20to%20false) in #inner-navigate-event-firing-algorithm.",
